{"strongs": "H7534", "word": "רַק", "translit": "raq", "root": "רקק", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "1. adjective", "gloss": "thin", "definition": "רַק 1. adjective thin ; — feminine plural רַקּוֺת , of kine, Gen 41:19 ; Gen 41:20 ; Gen 41:27 (|| v Gen 41:3 v Gen 41:4 דַּקּוֺת ). 2. 109 adverb with restrictive force, only, altogether, surely (synonym אַךְ ); — \\ \\ a. only , Gen 14:24 ; Gen 41:40 רַק הַכִּסֵּא אֶגְדַּל מִמֶּךָּ only as regards the throne, etc., Gen 47:22 רַק אַדְמַת הַכֹּהֲנִים לֹא קָנָה , Gen 50:8 ; Exod 8:5 רַק בַּיְאֹר תִּשָּׁאַרְנָה , Exod 10:17 וְיָסֵר מֵעָלַי רַק הַמָּוֶת הַזֶּה only this death, Deut 2:35 (compare Deut 20:14 ; Josh 8:2 ; Josh 8:27 ), Josh 3:11 ; Judg 6:39 (compare אַךְ ib. Gen 18:32 ; Exod 10:17 ), Exod 11:34 (circumstantial clause) רַק הִיא יְחִידָה (there being) only she, an only one, 1Sam 1:13 ; Amos 3:2 רק אתכם ידעתי only you have I known, etc., Job 1:15 ; Job 1:16 ; Job 1:17 ; Job 1:19 וָאִמָּֽלְטָה רַק אֲנִי לְבַדִּי I only , Ps 91:8 + often Once strengthening אַךְ , Num 12:2 ׳ הֲרַק אַךְבְּֿמשֶׁה דִּבֶּר י . And separated (as sometimes in English) from the word actually emphasized, Prov 13:10 רִק בְּזָדוֺן יִתֵּן מַצָּה by pride there only cometh [ נָתַן 1 z ] contention. \\ \\ b. prefixed to sentences , to add a limitation on something previously expressed (or implied), Gen 19:8 only to these men do nothing, Gen 24:8 רִק אֶתבְּֿנִי לֹאתָֿהֵ֫נָּה , Exod 8:24 I will let you go . . ., only go not far, v. Exod 8:25 ; Num 20:19 only — it is nothing — let me pass through on my feet (compare Deut 2:28 ); especially in Deuteronomic writers, as Deut 10:15 ; Deut 12:15 ; Deut 20:16 ; 1Kgs 3:2 ; 1Kgs 3:3 (compare 2Kgs 12:4 ; 2Kgs 14:4 ; 2Kgs 15:4 ; 2Kgs 15:35 ), 2Kgs 8:19 ; 2Kgs 11:13 ; 2Kgs 15:14 ; 2Kgs 15:23 ; 2Kgs 3:2 (compare 2Kgs 14:3 ; 2Kgs 17:2 ), etc., Isa 4:1 emphasizing a command, Deut 4:9 ; Deut 12:16 ; Deut 12:23 ; Josh 1:7 ; Josh 1:18 ; Josh 6:18 ; Josh 13:6 ; Josh 22:5 (all D 2 ). \\ \\ c. emphasizing single words, especially adjectives, only = nought but, altogether , Gen 6:5 יֵצֶר מַחְשְׁבוֺת לִבּוֺ רִק רִע is only evil, i.e. exclusively evil, nought but evil, Gen 26:29 עָשִׂינוּ עִמְּךָ רִק טוֺב nothing but good, Deut 28:33 וְהָיִיתָ רִק עָשׁוּק , Isa 28:19 רִק זְוָעָה it shall be nought but terror to, etc., 1Kgs 14:8 (compare אַךְ 2 b β ); followed by an adverb Deut 28:13 וְהָיִיתָ רִק לְמַ֫עְלָה above only ; followed by a verb, Judg 14:16 thou dost but hate me. \\ \\ d. after a negative, save, except (synonym כִּי אִם 2 a ), 1Kgs 8:9 ( = 2Chr 5:10 ) אֵין בָּאָרוֺן רִק שְׁנֵי לֻהוֺת הָאֲבָנִים , 2Chr 15:5 ; 2Chr 22:16 ( = 2Chr 18:15 ), 2Kgs 17:18 . \\ \\ e. with an affirmative, asseverative force, only, altogether = surely , Gen 20:11 רַק אֵין יִרְאַת אלהים במקום הזה , Deut 4:6 (so EV ; but Ges populus mere sapiens, so Di ), 1Kgs 21:25 ; 2Chr 28:10 ; Ps 32:6 רִק לְשֶׁטֶף מים רבים אליו לא יַגִּ֑יעוּ . feminine רִק אִם ( רִק prefixed for emphasis) if only, provided only , Deut 15:5 ׳ רִק אִם שׁמוע תשׁמע וג , 1Kgs 8:25 ( = 2Chr 6:16 ) רִק אִם ישׁמרו בניך דרכם ׳ ללכת וג , 2Kgs 21:8 ( = 2Chr 33:8 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8113')\">BDB8113</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7534')\">H7534</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7535')\">H7535</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8112')\">BDB8112</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8114')\">BDB8114</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>רַק</bdbheb> <div class=\"point\"><b>1. adjective</b> <highlightword>thin</highlightword>; — feminine plural <bdbheb>רַקּוֺת</bdbheb>, of kine, <ref ref=\"Gen 41:19\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,19)\">Gen 41:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 41:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,20)\">Gen 41:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 41:27\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,27)\">Gen 41:27</ref> (|| v<ref ref=\"Gen 41:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,3)\">Gen 41:3</ref> v<ref ref=\"Gen 41:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,4)\">Gen 41:4</ref> <bdbheb>דַּקּוֺת</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b><sub>109</sub> <b>adverb</b> with restrictive force, <highlightword>only, altogether, surely</highlightword> (synonym <bdbheb>אַךְ</bdbheb>); — <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <highlight>only</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 14:24\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(1,14,24)\">Gen 14:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 41:40\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(1,41,40)\">Gen 41:40</ref> <bdbheb>רַק הַכִּסֵּא אֶגְדַּל מִמֶּךָּ</bdbheb> <highlight>only</highlight> as regards the throne, etc., <ref ref=\"Gen 47:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,47,22)\">Gen 47:22</ref> <bdbheb>רַק אַדְמַת הַכֹּהֲנִים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לֹא קָנָה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Gen 50:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"50\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"50\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,50,8)\">Gen 50:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 8:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,5)\">Exod 8:5</ref> <bdbheb>רַק בַּיְאֹר תִּשָּׁאַרְנָה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Exod 10:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,17)\">Exod 10:17</ref> <bdbheb>וְיָסֵר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מֵעָלַי רַק הַמָּוֶת הַזֶּה</bdbheb> <highlight>only</highlight> this death, <ref ref=\"Deut 2:35\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,35)\">Deut 2:35</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"Deut 20:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,14)\">Deut 20:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:2\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,2)\">Josh 8:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 8:27\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,27)\">Josh 8:27</ref>), <ref ref=\"Josh 3:11\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(6,3,11)\">Josh 3:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:39\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,39)\">Judg 6:39</ref> (compare <bdbheb>אַךְ</bdbheb> <highlight>ib.</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,32)\">Gen 18:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 10:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,17)\">Exod 10:17</ref>), <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Exod 11:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,11,34)\">Exod 11:34</ref> (circumstantial clause) <bdbheb>רַק הִיא יְחִידָה</bdbheb> (there being) <highlight>only</highlight> she, an only one, <ref ref=\"1Sam 1:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,1,13)\">1Sam 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 3:2\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(30,3,2)\">Amos 3:2</ref> <bdbheb>רק אתכם ידעתי</bdbheb> <highlight>only</highlight> you have I known, etc., <ref ref=\"Job 1:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,15)\">Job 1:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 1:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,16)\">Job 1:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 1:17\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,17)\">Job 1:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 1:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,19)\">Job 1:19</ref> <bdbheb>וָאִמָּֽלְטָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>רַק אֲנִי לְבַדִּי</bdbheb> <highlight>I only</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 91:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"91\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"91\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,91,8)\">Ps 91:8</ref> + often Once strengthening <bdbheb>אַךְ</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Num 12:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,12,2)\">Num 12:2</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הֲרַק אַךְבְּֿמשֶׁה דִּבֶּר י</bdbheb>. And separated (as sometimes in English) from the word actually emphasized, <ref ref=\"Prov 13:10\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,10)\">Prov 13:10</ref> <bdbheb>רִק בְּזָדוֺן יִתֵּן מַצָּה</bdbheb> by pride there <highlight>only</highlight> cometh [<bdbheb>נָתַן</bdbheb> <b>1 z</b>] <highlightword>contention.</highlightword> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> prefixed to <highlight>sentences</highlight>, to add a limitation on something previously expressed (or implied), <ref ref=\"Gen 19:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,19,8)\">Gen 19:8</ref> <highlight>only</highlight> to these men do nothing, <ref ref=\"Gen 24:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,8)\">Gen 24:8</ref> <bdbheb>רִק אֶתבְּֿנִי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לֹאתָֿהֵ֫נָּה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Exod 8:24\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,24)\">Exod 8:24</ref> I will let you go . . ., <highlight>only</highlight> go not far, v.<ref ref=\"Exod 8:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,8,25)\">Exod 8:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 20:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,20,19)\">Num 20:19</ref> <highlight>only</highlight> — it is nothing — let me pass through on my feet (compare <ref ref=\"Deut 2:28\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(5,2,28)\">Deut 2:28</ref>); especially in Deuteronomic writers, as <ref ref=\"Deut 10:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,10,15)\">Deut 10:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,15)\">Deut 12:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 20:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,20,16)\">Deut 20:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:2\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,2)\">1Kgs 3:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 3:3\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(11,3,3)\">1Kgs 3:3</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 12:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,12,4)\">2Kgs 12:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,4)\">2Kgs 14:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,4)\">2Kgs 15:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,35)\">2Kgs 15:35</ref>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 8:19\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(12,8,19)\">2Kgs 8:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,13)\">2Kgs 11:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:14\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,14)\">2Kgs 15:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 15:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,15,23)\">2Kgs 15:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 3:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,3,2)\">2Kgs 3:2</ref> (compare <ref ref=\"2Kgs 14:3\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(12,14,3)\">2Kgs 14:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:2\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,2)\">2Kgs 17:2</ref>), etc., <ref ref=\"Isa 4:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,4,1)\">Isa 4:1</ref> emphasizing a command, <ref ref=\"Deut 4:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,9)\">Deut 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:16\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,16)\">Deut 12:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 12:23\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(5,12,23)\">Deut 12:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 1:7\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,7)\">Josh 1:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 1:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,1,18)\">Josh 1:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 6:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,6,18)\">Josh 6:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:6\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,6)\">Josh 13:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 22:5\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,5)\">Josh 22:5</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink><sup>2</sup></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> emphasizing single words, especially adjectives, <highlight>only</highlight> = <highlight>nought but, altogether</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 6:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,6,5)\">Gen 6:5</ref> <bdbheb>יֵצֶר מַחְשְׁבוֺת לִבּוֺ רִק רִע</bdbheb> is <highlight>only</highlight> evil, i.e. <highlight>exclusively</highlight> evil, <highlight>nought but</highlight> evil, <ref ref=\"Gen 26:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,29)\">Gen 26:29</ref> <bdbheb>עָשִׂינוּ עִמְּךָ רִק טוֺב</bdbheb> <highlight>nothing but</highlight> good, <ref ref=\"Deut 28:33\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,33)\">Deut 28:33</ref> <bdbheb>וְהָיִיתָ רִק עָשׁוּק</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Isa 28:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,19)\">Isa 28:19</ref> <bdbheb>רִק זְוָעָה</bdbheb> it shall be <highlight>nought but</highlight> terror to, etc., <ref ref=\"1Kgs 14:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,14,8)\">1Kgs 14:8</ref> (compare <bdbheb>אַךְ</bdbheb> <b>2 b</b> <grk>β</grk>); followed by an adverb <ref ref=\"Deut 28:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,13)\">Deut 28:13</ref> <bdbheb>וְהָיִיתָ רִק לְמַ֫עְלָה</bdbheb> above <highlight>only</highlight>; followed by a verb, <ref ref=\"Judg 14:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,14,16)\">Judg 14:16</ref> thou dost <highlight>but</highlight> hate me. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> after a negative, <highlight>save, except</highlight> (synonym <bdbheb>כִּי אִם</bdbheb> <b>2 a</b>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:9\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,9)\">1Kgs 8:9</ref> ( = <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,10)\">2Chr 5:10</ref>) <bdbheb>אֵין בָּאָרוֺן רִק שְׁנֵי לֻהוֺת הָאֲבָנִים</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"2Chr 15:5\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(14,15,5)\">2Chr 15:5</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"2Chr 22:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,22,16)\">2Chr 22:16</ref> ( = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,15)\">2Chr 18:15</ref>), <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,18)\">2Kgs 17:18</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> with an affirmative, asseverative force, <highlight>only, altogether = surely</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 20:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,11)\">Gen 20:11</ref> <bdbheb>רַק אֵין יִרְאַת אלהים במקום הזה</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Deut 4:6\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,6)\">Deut 4:6</ref> (so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('EV')\"><reflink>EV</reflink></lookup>; but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup> populus <highlight>mere</highlight> sapiens, so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 21:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,21,25)\">1Kgs 21:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 28:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,28,10)\">2Chr 28:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 32:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,32,6)\">Ps 32:6</ref> <bdbheb>רִק לְשֶׁטֶף מים רבים אליו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>לא יַגִּ֑יעוּ</bdbheb>. <b>feminine</b> <bdbheb>רִק אִם</bdbheb> (<bdbheb>רִק</bdbheb> prefixed for emphasis) <highlight>if only, provided only</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Deut 15:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,5)\">Deut 15:5</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רִק אִם שׁמוע תשׁמע וג</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:25\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,25)\">1Kgs 8:25</ref> ( = <ref ref=\"2Chr 6:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,6,16)\">2Chr 6:16</ref>) <bdbheb>רִק אִם ישׁמרו בניך דרכם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ללכת וג</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"2Kgs 21:8\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(12,21,8)\">2Kgs 21:8</ref> ( = <ref ref=\"2Chr 33:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,33,8)\">2Chr 33:8</ref>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 41:19", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Gen 41:20", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Gen 41:27", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Gen 41:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Gen 41:4", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Gen 14:24", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 14, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Gen 41:40", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 41, "verse": 40}, {"raw": "Gen 47:22", "book": "GEN", "chapter"